  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 627010,
    "RowId": 36300,
    "Text": "Clear Mount Rokkon"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 627042,
    "RowId": 36301,
    "Text": "Clear the Single Step"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 627074,
    "RowId": 36302,
    "Text": "Defeat Shishio"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 627102,
    "RowId": 36303,
    "Text": "Clear the Clever Roost"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 627138,
    "RowId": 36304,
    "Text": "Defeat Gorai the Uncaged"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 627174,
    "RowId": 36305,
    "Text": "Defeat Moko the Restless"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 627210,
    "RowId": 36306,
    "Text": "Three paths to be unsealed at our behest. Whither shall we wander?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 627290,
    "RowId": 36307,
    "Text": "You thought to go down this path as well? How reassuring!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 627358,
    "RowId": 36308,
    "Text": "Interested in a different path? I shall place my trust in your intuition."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 627442,
    "RowId": 36309,
    "Text": "A grand gate. What lies beyond, I wonder?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 627494,
    "RowId": 36310,
    "Text": "I espy a most promising pagoda! Let us make it our destination."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 627570,
    "RowId": 36311,
    "Text": "What curious creatures! They must have been emboldened by these terrible torrents."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 627666,
    "RowId": 36312,
    "Text": "Mountain weather is wont to change on a whim, but 'tis not nature's whims at work here..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 627766,
    "RowId": 36313,
    "Text": "Thank the kami the rains have ceased... We should make for shelter ere another storm passes through."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 627878,
    "RowId": 36314,
    "Text": "Such tumultuous spirits! Servants of the wind, no doubt."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 627946,
    "RowId": 36315,
    "Text": "These winds could blow a man away...and will, if we do not tread carefully!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 628034,
    "RowId": 36316,
    "Text": "A thousand thousand paths...and yours ends here."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 628094,
    "RowId": 36317,
    "Text": "Fill your lungs!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 628122,
    "RowId": 36318,
    "Text": "Dying embers are easily snuffed..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 628170,
    "RowId": 36319,
    "Text": "We are everything and nothing─your first and final breath!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 628242,
    "RowId": 36320,
    "Text": "Choke in your graves!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 628274,
    "RowId": 36321,
    "Text": "Slayer of spirits... Their fate will soon be yours!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 628338,
    "RowId": 36322,
    "Text": "Your soul is mine to claim! Your marrow, mine to burn..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 628406,
    "RowId": 36323,
    "Text": "These treasures are mine! All <i>mine</i>! You shall not sully their brilliance!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 628502,
    "RowId": 36324,
    "Text": "The head monk, I take it? And bearing a form befitting his proclivities..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 628590,
    "RowId": 36325,
    "Text": "火の神より賜りし力よ……\n琵琶の響きで、燃え立ち猛れ！"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 628686,
    "RowId": 36326,
    "Text": "火の神より賜りし力よ……\n琵琶の音色で、分かれて増えよ！"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 628782,
    "RowId": 36327,
    "Text": "Beware the biwa's melody, <split(<String>ObjectParameter(1)</String>, ,1)>! It resounds with power..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 628862,
    "RowId": 36328,
    "Text": "専門外なので私にはさっぱりデスが、\nアナタなら、演奏の違いもわかるのでは……？"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 628994,
    "RowId": 36329,
    "Text": "A song to guide you to your grave!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 629042,
    "RowId": 36330,
    "Text": "Beads to bind the spirit's form...\nWith these words, be reborn!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 629122,
    "RowId": 36331,
    "Text": "My blessings are your curse!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 629162,
    "RowId": 36332,
    "Text": "No mercy, no mercy!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 629194,
    "RowId": 36333,
    "Text": "Hee hee! You thought you were free of me!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 629246,
    "RowId": 36334,
    "Text": "Divine thunder, heed my call─bestow upon my biwa your tumultuous timbre!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 629334,
    "RowId": 36335,
    "Text": "My power will see you humbled!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 629378,
    "RowId": 36336,
    "Text": "A drink to fuel the fires of my fury!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 629426,
    "RowId": 36337,
    "Text": "Ahahaha! You are as nothing before my might!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 629482,
    "RowId": 36338,
    "Text": "Curses... The libations...!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 629522,
    "RowId": 36339,
    "Text": "You yet stand!?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 629550,
    "RowId": 36340,
    "Text": "No... My precious...treasures..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 629594,
    "RowId": 36341,
    "Text": "Divine fire, I beseech thee─cleanse the branded with blessed flame!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 629674,
    "RowId": 36342,
    "Text": "Divine thunder, heed my call─sound to rend the very earth!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 629746,
    "RowId": 36343,
    "Text": "There is no salvation for thieves... I offer you death, and nothing more!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 629830,
    "RowId": 36344,
    "Text": "It shall be mine...mine, I say! You cannot have it!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 629894,
    "RowId": 36345,
    "Text": "The dance of a thousand petals begins with a single blossom!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 629966,
    "RowId": 36346,
    "Text": "Wayward flowers, bend to my will!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 630010,
    "RowId": 36347,
    "Text": "Spring has come!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 630038,
    "RowId": 36348,
    "Text": "Embrace ephemerality!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 630070,
    "RowId": 36349,
    "Text": "My shadow is my strength!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 630106,
    "RowId": 36350,
    "Text": "In summer's blaze do my blades sing... In winter's chill do they bite!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 630190,
    "RowId": 36351,
    "Text": "The sky weeps, and the earth heeds her call!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 630246,
    "RowId": 36352,
    "Text": "Death blooms in a raging tempest!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 630290,
    "RowId": 36353,
    "Text": "Come forth, dear friends, and beguile mine enemies!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 630354,
    "RowId": 36354,
    "Text": "Solitary leaves, I call upon you─fly at the mercy of the storm!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 630430,
    "RowId": 36355,
    "Text": "Reeds of the earth, take to the skies!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 630482,
    "RowId": 36356,
    "Text": "From accursed boughs do wicked buds bloom!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 630538,
    "RowId": 36357,
    "Text": "Under normal circumstances, I would find this ninjutsu endearing... Would that her petals did not seek to do us harm!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 630666,
    "RowId": 36358,
    "Text": "The blossoms must be enchanted. Keep a watchful eye on how they fly, <split(<String>ObjectParameter(1)</String>, ,1)>!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 630766,
    "RowId": 36359,
    "Text": "I should like to pat their fluffy little heads, but a well-trained pup will go to great lengths to protect its master..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 630898,
    "RowId": 36360,
    "Text": "Face me, and I shall grant you an honorable death!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 630962,
    "RowId": 36361,
    "Text": "My blade thirsts for mortal blood!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 631010,
    "RowId": 36362,
    "Text": "To me, my warriors! Your lord has need of you!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 631070,
    "RowId": 36363,
    "Text": "That my blade could miss its mark... You are a formidable foe."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 631146,
    "RowId": 36364,
    "Text": "In tenebrous night shall you meet your end..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 631202,
    "RowId": 36365,
    "Text": "In gardens of flame do true warriors thrive!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 631258,
    "RowId": 36366,
    "Text": "War is a sea of sorrow, and you shall drown!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 631314,
    "RowId": 36367,
    "Text": "My blade is inescapable!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 631350,
    "RowId": 36368,
    "Text": "My ire is an infernal flame, never to be smothered!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 631414,
    "RowId": 36369,
    "Text": "Our spirits are as the wind, never to be fettered!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 631478,
    "RowId": 36370,
    "Text": "To arms, my warriors! We make for the front lines!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 631542,
    "RowId": 36371,
    "Text": "I once dreamed of shaking hands with a giant oni, but not like this!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 631622,
    "RowId": 36372,
    "Text": "They may have strength in numbers, but worry not! If you cannot beat them, dodge them, I say!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 631726,
    "RowId": 36373,
    "Text": "Thank the kami the winds have ceased... We should make for shelter ere we are blown back to the foot of the mountain!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 631854,
    "RowId": 36374,
    "Text": "If I had to wager a guess, these must be the temple's stores. Rather spacious, aren't they?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 631958,
    "RowId": 36375,
    "Text": "Were I a treasure─cursed or no─I imagine I would abide within these walls. But where..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 632062,
    "RowId": 36376,
    "Text": "Under the auspices of two auspices, as it were. Curious."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 632130,
    "RowId": 36377,
    "Text": "So the glass serves as a magicked doorknob of sorts? The monks were certainly inventive..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 632234,
    "RowId": 36378,
    "Text": "You too are a connoisseur of Far Eastern maps, I trust? Terribly charming, how the Four Lords are shown ruling the cardinal directions."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 632382,
    "RowId": 36379,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 632394,
    "RowId": 36380,
    "Text": "I might have known that Suzaku and Seiryu were the guardians of this gateway─though in fairness, one usually needs grapple with only one at a time. "
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 632558,
    "RowId": 36381,
    "Text": "...Would that we had arrived sooner. Judging by her supernatural size, the demons have already taken that poor shinobi."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 632690,
    "RowId": 36382,
    "Text": "She must be in the thrall of a treasure. A promising lead...though at an unfortunate cost."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 632794,
    "RowId": 36383,
    "Text": "I see no clockwork mechanisms... We've an honest-to-kami mononoke on our hands."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 632886,
    "RowId": 36384,
    "Text": "The bloodlust is palpable... Have care, <split(<String>ObjectParameter(1)</String>, ,1)>! I shall be right here─at a reasonably safe distance─cheering you on!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 633030,
    "RowId": 36385,
    "Text": "Excellent work, <split(<String>ObjectParameter(1)</String>, ,1)>! I knew from the first you would emerge victori─"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 633126,
    "RowId": 36386,
    "Text": "...What, pray tell, is that look for?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 633174,
    "RowId": 36387,
    "Text": "Your faith in my faith in you aside, you may be interested to know that I recognize the detailing on this armor. It once belonged to a renowned warrior. "
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 633338,
    "RowId": 36388,
    "Text": "Would that my falcon had the freight capacity of a barge..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 633410,
    "RowId": 36389,
    "Text": "Alas, I suppose I must choose which artifacts to leave behind─for now."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 633494,
    "RowId": 36390,
    "Text": "Well done, <split(<String>ObjectParameter(1)</String>, ,1)>! Even the fiercest mononoke is no match for you!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 633582,
    "RowId": 36391,
    "Text": "'Tis difficult to appreciate while under threat of slicing and dicing, but the monks amassed a truly impressive collection of blades here."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 633734,
    "RowId": 36392,
    "Text": "To say naught of our most enspirited armor!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 633790,
    "RowId": 36393,
    "Text": "Perhaps the soul of the warrior who once wore it yet lingered, awaiting his chance to take to the battlefield once more..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 633926,
    "RowId": 36394,
    "Text": "Or perhaps his sword was a treasure with a life of its own."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 633998,
    "RowId": 36395,
    "Text": "A vexing conundrum─what to bring back to Kugane, that is. I don't suppose you've space in your bag...?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 634114,
    "RowId": 36396,
    "Text": "Well done, <split(<String>ObjectParameter(1)</String>, ,1)>! You are an unholy terror on the battlefield─and I mean that in the most flattering way."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 634246,
    "RowId": 36397,
    "Text": "To think that our secret passage would lead us to such an immaculate armory... Perhaps the monks utilized this as a shelter in times of strife."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 634402,
    "RowId": 36398,
    "Text": "I doubt they expected the armor they stored to come to life, however. Quite the harrowing foe, that one."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 634518,
    "RowId": 36399,
    "Text": "...Which leads me to believe that the armor itself must be one of the treasures we seek!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 634618,
    "RowId": 36400,
    "Text": "Despite its storied history, it looks almost pristine. I suspect the monks tended to it regularly."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 634730,
    "RowId": 36401,
    "Text": "It shall prove quite the challenge to bring back...but I daresay my falcon and I are up to the task! Pray accept my unending gratitude for your assistance, <split(<String>ObjectParameter(1)</String>, ,1)>."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 634914,
    "RowId": 36402,
    "Text": "A clash for the ages! Life-threatening circumstances aside, 'tis always a pleasure to witness bushido at work."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 635038,
    "RowId": 36403,
    "Text": "I had guessed the passage we traversed would lead us to the stores' most valuable contents─lo and behold!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 635158,
    "RowId": 36404,
    "Text": "Such exceptional relics are a rarity indeed...this armor not least of all."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 635246,
    "RowId": 36405,
    "Text": "The spirit that enlivened it may have been one of the very tsukumogami of rumor."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 635338,
    "RowId": 36406,
    "Text": "In an ideal world, I would not hesitate to bring home every last blade the mononoke touched... Alas, my falcon can only bear so much weight."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 635490,
    "RowId": 36407,
    "Text": "This calls for serious consideration... Pray leave me to my thoughts for a moment."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 635586,
    "RowId": 36408,
    "Text": "How pleasingly picturesque! Had we no demons to slay, I would suggest a more leisurely stroll."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 635694,
    "RowId": 36409,
    "Text": "I shudder to think of the chaos should those creatures find their way to civilization..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 635794,
    "RowId": 36410,
    "Text": "I suppose we're obliged to take the scenic route."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 635854,
    "RowId": 36411,
    "Text": "That ahead is Shojo Temple, home to Gorai and his accursed collection!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 635938,
    "RowId": 36412,
    "Text": "If only we had time for the typical ablutions... But a proper pilgrimage must wait for another day."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 636050,
    "RowId": 36413,
    "Text": "For now, treasure awaits! As do the monk and his minions, of course. Do have care."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 636146,
    "RowId": 36414,
    "Text": "I admit that I was equally tempted to pull that rope, though part of me wishes you hadn't..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 636250,
    "RowId": 36415,
    "Text": "The statues keep silent vigil in their masters' absence...but they are not the treasures we seek. Onward!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 636366,
    "RowId": 36416,
    "Text": "The temple stretches on ever further. Step lively, <split(<String>ObjectParameter(1)</String>, ,1)>! We've plenty to explore."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 636470,
    "RowId": 36417,
    "Text": "Even the inner sanctum is plagued with demons. If any who remained did survive, 'twould be nothing short of a miracle."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 636602,
    "RowId": 36418,
    "Text": "Splendid as these statues are, they appear lacking in the “accursed” aspect. Our quarry must lie further in."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 636726,
    "RowId": 36419,
    "Text": "Though the temple's isolation is a blessing for the smallfolk, I imagine it made the monks' experience all the more harrowing..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 636866,
    "RowId": 36420,
    "Text": "We have yet to see hide nor hair of Gorai..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 636922,
    "RowId": 36421,
    "Text": "Breathtaking! 'Tis as though the majestic tiger it depicts might pounce off the screen at any─ Oh?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 637034,
    "RowId": 36422,
    "Text": "That was <i>not</i> an invitation! Your assistance, please, <split(<String>ObjectParameter(1)</String>, ,1)>!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 637126,
    "RowId": 36423,
    "Text": "That precarious pile of crates is a mountain unto itself! "
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 637198,
    "RowId": 36424,
    "Text": "Somehow, I doubt that brute has learned its lesson... But let us continue on."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 637286,
    "RowId": 36425,
    "Text": "By the kami, <split(<String>ObjectParameter(1)</String>, ,1)>, how did you get up there?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 637354,
    "RowId": 36426,
    "Text": "Adventurers and their climbing... Why, just the other day, on Kugane Tower─ But perhaps that is a tale for another time."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 637490,
    "RowId": 36427,
    "Text": "That sounded promising... If you suddenly hear my winsome wailing, you had best come running!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 637594,
    "RowId": 36428,
    "Text": "Ah, a secret stairwell! How very convenient."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 637650,
    "RowId": 36429,
    "Text": "Both master and minion, irascible to the last..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 637710,
    "RowId": 36430,
    "Text": "Tokimori's words ring true. These creatures allow for not a modicum of mercy."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 637798,
    "RowId": 36431,
    "Text": "With your victory, we may now free the mountain of Gorai's influence─by liberating these treasures from his collection, of course."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 637942,
    "RowId": 36432,
    "Text": "Any one of them may have harbored spiritual forces. Perhaps all of them─it would certainly explain Gorai's impressive transformation."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 638090,
    "RowId": 36433,
    "Text": "As for which deserves a place in my collection... Gorai's biwa, of course! A fine addition."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 638194,
    "RowId": 36434,
    "Text": "And with that, we may be on our way. Your company has been a pleasure as always, <split(<String>ObjectParameter(1)</String>, ,1)>."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 638306,
    "RowId": 36435,
    "Text": "And so the demon is slain!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 638346,
    "RowId": 36436,
    "Text": "Though his avarice availed him curious tools, your skill carried the day."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 638430,
    "RowId": 36437,
    "Text": "One wonders what artifacts he might have unveiled had you waited a touch longer to deal the killing blow...but there's naught to be done about it now. "
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 638594,
    "RowId": 36438,
    "Text": "Naught but to take the lesson of his life to heart, perhaps. Never shirk the proper appraisal of items with dubious histories!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 638734,
    "RowId": 36439,
    "Text": "Bearing this firmly in mind, I shall help myself to that hammer of his."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 638818,
    "RowId": 36440,
    "Text": "'Twas an honor and a privilege to accompany you, <split(<String>ObjectParameter(1)</String>, ,1)>! Shall we begin our preparations for the journey back?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 638950,
    "RowId": 36441,
    "Text": "Admirable as always, <split(<String>ObjectParameter(1)</String>, ,1)>! Few would be so keen to face down a rat of that size."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 639054,
    "RowId": 36442,
    "Text": "To say naught of his unusual sousing. When the unholy draught touched his lips, I feared his fury would consume the entire temple."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 639198,
    "RowId": 36443,
    "Text": "I should like to know precisely what baleful influence was wrought upon the drink...but not enough to test it myself."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 639326,
    "RowId": 36444,
    "Text": "Nay, I must bring back a less volatile artifact of our endeavors..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 639406,
    "RowId": 36445,
    "Text": "The living lanterns─chochin, as the Hingans say─were particularly fascinating, were they not? "
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 639518,
    "RowId": 36446,
    "Text": "Now that they are returned to their original form, I may safely seek to learn more of the spirits they once harbored. Let us add them to my collection forthwith!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 639690,
    "RowId": 36447,
    "Text": "Curious... This lantern shines differently than the rest. The mononoke's influence, perhaps?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 639794,
    "RowId": 36448,
    "Text": "No, some other mechanism. What if I..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 639846,
    "RowId": 36449,
    "Text": "Lesson learned, Hancock─do <i>not</i> prod eerily glowing objects!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 639930,
    "RowId": 36450,
    "Text": "In any case, the monks went to great pains to conceal this path. What could have warranted such secrecy?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 640046,
    "RowId": 36451,
    "Text": "Kami forfend! We could suffocate under this wicked haze..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 640118,
    "RowId": 36452,
    "Text": "I'd wager the tsukumogami is the pipe itself─its body a mere illusion."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 640202,
    "RowId": 36453,
    "Text": "A brilliant display! With the demonic smoke dispelled, we may breathe easy once more."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 640298,
    "RowId": 36454,
    "Text": "Only an entity of great power could transform its surrounds so dramatically. You did well to outmaneuver it."
  }
]